  <div class="text-holder">
    <h3 class="title">Direct Operator -  Local Owner</h3>                          
    <p>We are direct operators. You book with us, you trek with us. We are a renowned local trekking agency in Nepal that has been organizing treks and tours for many years.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="col">
  <div class="icon-holder">
